, {"content": {"incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!"}, "type": "feedback"}], "type": "RSLT", "template_override": 1, "questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "responses": [{"_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "correct": 0, "id": 0, "selected": 0}, {"_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "correct": 1, "id": 1, "selected": 0}], "id": 0}]}, {"stimuli_ids": [], "id": 11, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " \nWrite a dialogue of two people coming to a compromise.\n", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Take Away", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!"}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "\nInstructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment.\n", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "DWS", "template_override": 1, "questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "engenn10le18ob09re7pdf01.pdf", "type": "pdf"}]}], "responses": [{"_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "correct": 1, "id": 0, "selected": 0}], "id": 0}]}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "template_override": 1, "id": 0, "contents": [{}]}, {"title": "", "id": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn10le18ob09re2img01.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn10le18ob09re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn10le18ob09re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn10le18ob09re2img01.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<p>Good evening, everyone. So good to be here. I'm Jessica Tollens.  If you will allow me, I'd like to start with a scenario.  Imagine this: you are a dynamic person.  You are planning to launch a new product. You've prepared the proposal, but your close colleague wants to make important changes before you sell it to the boss. You might think: \u201cI can't believe it!  This really makes me mad!\u201d  You might say to yourself: \u201cI won't make any changes!\u201d or \u201cIf this goes on, I will abandon the project!\u201d In this situation, you have to come to a compromise.</p>"}, {"time": "35000", "image": "engenn10le18ob09re2img02.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<p>You may be wondering where I got this 'situation' from. As a human resources consultant, I see situations like this one every day.  Compromising can be difficult. It makes you feel  like you have lost. It's important to know when to stand your ground, but also when to choose your battles.  In this speech, I will give you some pointers to follow when a compromise is the best solution. Then, I will talk about some strategies for negotiating a good compromise.  To prepare for this speech, I consulted my business partner on why compromising is important.</p>"}, {"time": "69000", "image": "engenn10le18ob09re2img03.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<p>We believe that a compromise doesn't have to be equal to be acceptable. You need to ask yourself why is this something you should agree to. In my view, your ability to get things done at work almost always depends on the cooperation of other people.</p>\n<p>I maintain that the best negotiators start by saying something positive like, \u201cI value your leadership, and I would like to speak openly and honestly with you.\u201d  This makes the other person feel that they are in a safe space, and they will be more likely to agree to a compromise.</p>"}]}}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}